    "detailed_description": "Misfits is a cooperative puzzle game where you and your friends are the missing pieces of an oncoming wall. Scramble to break obstacles, collect pickups, and position your bodies to fit through the hole before you get squished! Puzzles get trickier with fun, unique obstacles to navigate and overcome.<br><br>Are you looking for a game that's easy to pick up but hard to put down?<br>Are you looking for a game that's casual but also a little bit competitive? <br>Are you looking for a wholesome game to play with family?<br><br>(Hint you're in the right place!)<br><br>Enjoy three game modes: Survival, Versus, and Freeplay<br><br>Survival: Play cooperatively and record your high scores on a global leaderboard<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b4f0c8293888139156052da5ed2089f6.poster.avif?t=1738637602\" width=320 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b4f0c8293888139156052da5ed2089f6.webm?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b4f0c8293888139156052da5ed2089f6.mp4?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Versus: Team up and sabotage your opponent's flow<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b2cfdff383774af78e1c5492ea26d180.poster.avif?t=1738637602\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b2cfdff383774af78e1c5492ea26d180.webm?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b2cfdff383774af78e1c5492ea26d180.mp4?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Freeplay: No stakes, casual puzzling. Great for novice players!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/e8b31f777e1b0277209bbd230ff534b0.poster.avif?t=1738637602\" width=320 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/e8b31f777e1b0277209bbd230ff534b0.webm?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/e8b31f777e1b0277209bbd230ff534b0.mp4?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Misfits is a cooperative puzzle game where you and your friends are the missing pieces of an oncoming wall. Scramble to break obstacles, collect pickups, and position your bodies to fit through the hole before you get squished! Puzzles get trickier with fun, unique obstacles to navigate and overcome.<br><br>Are you looking for a game that's easy to pick up but hard to put down?<br>Are you looking for a game that's casual but also a little bit competitive? <br>Are you looking for a wholesome game to play with family?<br><br>(Hint you're in the right place!)<br><br>Enjoy three game modes: Survival, Versus, and Freeplay<br><br>Survival: Play cooperatively and record your high scores on a global leaderboard<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b4f0c8293888139156052da5ed2089f6.poster.avif?t=1738637602\" width=320 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b4f0c8293888139156052da5ed2089f6.webm?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b4f0c8293888139156052da5ed2089f6.mp4?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Versus: Team up and sabotage your opponent's flow<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b2cfdff383774af78e1c5492ea26d180.poster.avif?t=1738637602\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b2cfdff383774af78e1c5492ea26d180.webm?t=1738637602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894880/extras/b2cfdff383774af78e1c5492ea26d180.mp4?t=173863760